<title>UK: Argentina prices $1.0 bln 10-year bond, +445 b.p..</title>
<headline>Argentina prices $1.0 bln 10-year bond, +445 b.p..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's $1.0 billion 10-year global bond has been priced, joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Salomon Brothers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on Tuesday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $750 MLN  COUPON     11.00 PCT MATURITY    09.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.583    PAY DATE    09.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.583    SPREAD	+445 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX/B.A.  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  ARGENTINA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.JUL.06</p>
